        "score": 10,
        "rationale": "The term is percent-encoded with urllib.parse.quote(term, safe=\"\"), so &, =, quotes and angle brackets are encoded. The full href and the visible text are both escaped with html.escape (quote=True by default), so payloads like `\"><script>x</script>` or `a&b=c` cannot break out of the attribute, the text node or the q parameter."
